 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "greedfall-27092@1",
   "gameId": "greedfall-27092",
   "displayName": "Update 1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-09-26T12:36:38.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello Renaigse,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you everyone for helping us pinpoint bugs and issues in the past few weeks. Our team is still working on a new patch aiming to fix them. As we want to provide you with the best patch possible, we chose to first open it to volunteers who would like to test it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you choose to try out the Beta patch, please get in touch with us and share your views on this new update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚠ If you want to try out this patch, we HIGHLY recommend creating a backup of your local saves in Documents/GreedFall.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚠ Once you’ve tried it out, please remember that saves created in this new branch can’t load anymore once you have gone back to the main branch. This also goes for your user settings as they will be reset once you go back to the main branch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To get access to the new beta branch, you can head to your library and right-click on GreedFall -> Properties -> Beta -> Choose the branch “next_patch”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can already get a first glimpse at our changelog by checking out this post we published earlier this week. Once the patch is out, we will publish a detailed changelog.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you again! We can’t wait to see you on Teer Fradee!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
